							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div style="overflow: auto; width: 100%;">DV-One is finally getting his day in court. We need to show up and support<br /><br />March 19, 8:30 a.m., E1201&nbsp; at The King County Courthouse, 516 3rd Avenue, Seattle, is where we will start. <br /><br />We need as many people from the community as possible to show up this day and every day of the trial. Put it in your calendars now. And pass this on. The jury needs to see that DV has the support of the community, and they need to know they will be held accountable for their decision. <br /><br /></div>
